        {
          "comments": "NOT REVIEWED — raw running config supplied for manual review; no automated pass, finding, or applicability decision asserted.",
          "finding_details": "Raw running config SHA-256: be6b611a6ce3af30cfad1166d418ae98034301b63423515ba5bf0b069a79f313\nOfficial Cisco benchmark SHA-256: 90dfb2d1999ae3f3b6cc09350ff02a0ba306a53dadf6f4171394e819ecc966f2\nRunning config alone does not verify this control's complete operational check; manual review required.",
