          "fix_text": "Configure the switch to log events containing information to establish where the events occurred as shown in the example below: \n\nSW1(config)#ip access-list extended INGRESS_FILTER \n… \n… \n… \nSW1(config-ext-nacl)#deny ip any any log-input",
